OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England
OL,6,
OL,7,FPower cuts are affecting nearly 7,000
OL,8,Fhomes in Cornwall and Devon as Storm
OL,9,FAusten hits parts of the UK
OL,11,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) says speed
OL,12,Flimits will be in place on routes
OL,13,Fbetween Devon and Cornwall until 13:00
OL,14,FBST, while flights to and from Exeter
OL,15,FAirport have been cancelled
OL,17,FA red warning is in place for Guernsey
OL,18,Fand Jersey; Cornwall and parts of Devon
OL,19,Fare under an amber weather warning for
OL,20,Fstrong winds. A yellow rain warning is
OL,21,Fin place in parts of Scotland,
OL,22,Fincluding the Lothian Borders
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
