OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes south-west England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA further yellow weather warning for
OL,8,Fwind is kicking in from 10:00 for
OL,9,Fmillions across the South East and
OL,10,FNorth West of England, the East
OL,11,FMidlands and Wales
OL,13,FAll schools in Jersey have been told to
OL,14,Fclose on Friday. A number of schools
OL,15,Fare also closed or opening late in
OL,16,FCornwall
OL,18,FDevon County Council is urging people
OL,19,Fto postpone non-essential journeys
OL,20,Fwhile in Cornwall locals report
OL,21,Fdisruptions due to fallen trees and
OL,22,Fpower lines
